{"articleNo":"182930","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=182930&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"교육부 주요정책 홍보동영상 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.11.06","hit":"3102","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">우리 정부가 현재 추진중인 정책 홍보동영상을 다음과 같이 안내하여 드립니다.</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 평창동계올림픽(지정과제)</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 중학교 자유학기제(교육부)</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 임금체불 예발(고용노동부)</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 2017 대한민국 균형발전 박람회(산업통상자원부)</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 고용복지플러스센터 홍보(행정안전부)</span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style